<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept M2+CD money supply up 3.5 pct yr/yr-BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept M2+CD money supply up 3.5 pct yr/yr-BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's broadly defined money supply average of M2 plus certificates of deposit (CDs) grew a preliminary 3.5 percent in September from a year earlier, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>A breakdown of money supply figures follows:</p>
<p>(Year-on-year percentage changes)</p>
<p>				SEPT PRELIM  AUG REVISED JULY</p>
<p> Unadjusted M2 + CDs    +3.5	  +3.7	  + 3.7</p>
<p>    M1		     +12.0	 +13.8	  +14.3</p>
<p>    CDs		     +26.2	 +40.3	  +54.0</p>
<p>				SEPT PRELIM  AUG REVISED JULY</p>
<p> Broadest money measure +3.7	  +3.8	  + 4.0</p>
<p>(Annualised month-on-month percentage changes)</p>
<p>				SEPT PRELIM  AUG REVISED JULY</p>
<p> Adjusted M2 + CDs	+1.1	  +2.5	  - 0.4</p>
<p>(Annualised month-on-month percentage changes)</p>
<p>				SEPT PRELIM  AUG REVISED JULY</p>
<p> Adjusted M2 + CDs	+1.1	  +2.5	- 0.4</p>
<p>(Average outstanding yen levels)</p>
<p>				SEPT PRELIM  AUG REVISED JULY</p>
<p> Unadjusted M2+CDs     556.2 trln  556.9 trln 558.0 trln</p>
<p>    M1		     163.3 trln  163.4 trln 165.3 trln</p>
<p>    CDs		     13.7 trln   13.1 trln  12.8 trln</p>
<p>			     SEPT PRELIM  AUG?REVISED  JULY</p>
<p>Broadest liquidity  1,123.7 trln1,121.4 trln1,122.3 trln</p>
</text>
